WEBVTT

00:00:07.540 --> 00:00:10.020
Hokuto Shijima is in District TF13.

00:00:10.680 --> 00:00:14.110
Masumi Koutsu has entered District ZX97.

00:00:14.340 --> 00:00:16.450
I don't see Yaiba Toudou.

00:00:16.450 --> 00:00:19.060
He's outside the strategic area.

00:00:19.060 --> 00:00:20.470
Call him back immediately!

00:00:20.850 --> 00:00:23.710
Those three wanted to handle this?

00:00:23.710 --> 00:00:26.120
That's why I was against using students-

00:00:26.120 --> 00:00:27.620
Keep paying attention!

00:00:28.740 --> 00:00:29.810
President!

00:00:30.170 --> 00:00:33.160
They will definitely show up.

00:00:34.580 --> 00:00:40.310
Implementing mass into Solid 
Vision has created Action Duels.

00:00:40.310 --> 00:00:45.080
In duels where the field, monsters 
and duelists become one,

00:00:45.080 --> 00:00:48.090
the people are caught in 
a frenzy of excitement!

00:00:49.780 --> 00:00:52.400
Believe x Believe  Biri-Biri-Biri Buddies!

00:01:08.090 --> 00:01:11.180
You!  The strongest card 
isn't about winning or losing

00:01:11.500 --> 00:01:14.590
You!  At full speed  On the game

00:01:21.640 --> 00:01:23.330
Swinging ma ma ma mind

00:01:23.330 --> 00:01:27.900
The soul's pendulum  Ultimate confusion

00:01:28.450 --> 00:01:30.100
Impulse  Got it got it

00:01:30.100 --> 00:01:35.310
Tough battles  Real revolution

00:01:41.660 --> 00:01:46.070
Everybody goin'  Break through the walls!

00:01:48.290 --> 00:01:52.990
Infinite future  Get rid of indecision!

00:01:53.680 --> 00:01:56.930
Make it Make it  Be courageous (Break it now)

00:01:56.930 --> 00:02:00.330
Step ahead!  Take a step (Do it now)

00:02:00.330 --> 00:02:10.610
The fun is only getting started!  
So everyone's a Believer!!

00:02:10.930 --> 00:02:13.950
Believe x Believe  Biri-Biri-Biri Buddies!

00:02:18.120 --> 00:02:23.990
Wings of Rebellion  Raidraptor

00:02:24.510 --> 00:02:29.860
Since I made the Junior Youth Championship, 
we'll have a big party to celebrate!

00:02:29.860 --> 00:02:31.500
It's still too early!

00:02:32.170 --> 00:02:34.400
I still have one match left.

00:02:34.400 --> 00:02:36.480
We'll celebrate after I win

00:02:36.480 --> 00:02:40.140
But what if you don't win, Yuya?

00:02:40.140 --> 00:02:41.680
I don't get a party?

00:02:41.680 --> 00:02:43.120
How dare you!

00:02:43.120 --> 00:02:45.600
Because I want to eat cake!

00:02:45.600 --> 00:02:49.310
When I win, I'll force feed 
you until you can't take it!

00:02:49.310 --> 00:02:50.680
That tickles!

00:02:52.200 --> 00:02:54.920
This card doesn't suit you.

00:03:04.280 --> 00:03:05.280
Give up?

00:03:05.280 --> 00:03:06.530
Where are you going, Yuzu?

00:03:07.020 --> 00:03:08.700
I have an errand to run!

00:03:09.140 --> 00:03:10.170
Errand?

00:03:10.170 --> 00:03:11.870
You're getting my cake?

00:03:12.440 --> 00:03:14.310
Sorry!  Go home without me!

00:03:27.510 --> 00:03:28.450
You're alone?

00:03:30.190 --> 00:03:32.320
What about that kid and girl from last time?

00:03:33.200 --> 00:03:34.560
I don't know.

00:03:35.200 --> 00:03:41.400
I always thought the man in the 
black mask attacked Professor Marco.

00:03:41.680 --> 00:03:43.270
What did you do to Professor Marco?

00:03:43.680 --> 00:03:44.700
Marco?

00:03:45.200 --> 00:03:49.140
He's my LDS teacher who 
taught me Fusion Summoning!

00:03:49.680 --> 00:03:50.980
Oh him.

00:03:52.350 --> 00:03:54.540
He wasn't that skilled.

00:03:54.540 --> 00:03:58.850
He didn't have actual combat experience, 
so he was pitiful and weak-

00:03:58.850 --> 00:03:59.720
Be quiet!

00:03:59.720 --> 00:04:03.290
Don't you dare insult Professor Marco!

00:04:03.520 --> 00:04:05.370
I'm not just talking about Marco.

00:04:05.370 --> 00:04:08.440
Everyone in LDS is weak.

00:04:08.440 --> 00:04:13.670
I didn't sense iron will or steel 
determination in their dueling.

00:04:13.950 --> 00:04:16.600
You're also responsible 
for the other incidents?

00:04:16.940 --> 00:04:18.480
It was me.

00:04:18.930 --> 00:04:23.320
If you want to make me pay, then 
defeat me to get your revenge!

00:04:24.310 --> 00:04:28.120
President, the team is ready to 
go whenever you give the orders.

00:04:28.120 --> 00:04:29.310
Target acquired!

00:04:29.580 --> 00:04:31.110
Hokuto!  Yaiba!

00:04:31.110 --> 00:04:31.980
Come here now!

00:04:31.980 --> 00:04:33.020
Understood!

00:04:33.420 --> 00:04:36.340
Sorry, but you'll have to train on your own.

00:04:40.880 --> 00:04:43.830
I can't let you go beyond this point.

00:04:46.040 --> 00:04:51.070
You called your allies, but you must 
underestimate me if you only called two people.

00:04:51.380 --> 00:04:52.880
Don't worry.

00:04:52.880 --> 00:04:56.240
I already sent your information to LDS.

00:04:56.480 --> 00:05:02.210
Since I know your identity, I walked 
around the city to lure you out.

00:05:02.620 --> 00:05:06.440
I caught you in our trap!

00:05:06.440 --> 00:05:07.720
Exactly.

00:05:08.260 --> 00:05:10.000
Don't worry, Masumi.

00:05:10.000 --> 00:05:13.400
I promise to get Professor Marco's revenge!

00:05:13.400 --> 00:05:16.660
Let's finish him before Top Team arrives!

00:05:16.970 --> 00:05:20.300
If we catch the culprit, 
we'll get more opportunities!

00:05:21.060 --> 00:05:23.400
Yaiba!  Hokuto!

00:05:24.750 --> 00:05:26.740
Let's duel using battle royal rules!

00:05:27.280 --> 00:05:30.580
No one can draw or battle 
on their first turn.

00:05:30.800 --> 00:05:34.180
Fine.  I'll defeat you all together.

00:05:35.770 --> 00:05:38.120
I don't want you interfering with my friend.

00:05:38.620 --> 00:05:41.200
Friend?  You mean that guy from before?

00:05:41.700 --> 00:05:44.060
Is he battling Masumi again?

00:05:48.090 --> 00:05:49.370
Duel!

00:05:50.260 --> 00:05:51.700
Go first and win!

00:05:51.700 --> 00:05:53.130
Go, Masumi!

00:05:53.460 --> 00:05:54.900
My turn!

00:05:54.900 --> 00:05:57.780
I summon Gem-Knight Lapis!

00:06:01.280 --> 00:06:04.110
I set one card and end my turn.

00:06:04.340 --> 00:06:05.780
It's your turn, punk.

00:06:06.940 --> 00:06:08.110
My turn.

00:06:08.620 --> 00:06:12.420
I summon Raidraptor - Vanishing 
Lanius from my hand.

00:06:16.090 --> 00:06:19.550
When it's summoned or 
Special Summoned this turn,

00:06:19.550 --> 00:06:23.030
I can Special Summon Vanishing 
Lanius from my hand.

00:06:25.600 --> 00:06:29.510
I activate the Continuous 
Spell Raidraptor - Nest!

00:06:29.510 --> 00:06:34.030
When I have two Raidraptors 
with the same name on my field,

00:06:34.030 --> 00:06:37.960
I can add another from my deck to my hand.

00:06:39.900 --> 00:06:42.760
Due to the second Vanishing Lanius's effect,

00:06:42.760 --> 00:06:46.040
I can Special Summon Vanishing 
Lanius from my hand.

00:06:46.040 --> 00:06:48.820
I set two cards and end my turn.

00:06:49.880 --> 00:06:51.260
Please stop them!

00:06:51.540 --> 00:06:53.560
You stopped him last time!

00:06:53.780 --> 00:06:54.860
Why not now?

00:06:55.600 --> 00:06:57.060
You don't need to know.

00:06:58.260 --> 00:06:59.600
I don't want you involved.

00:07:05.380 --> 00:07:07.010
I don't want to hurt you!

00:07:09.720 --> 00:07:10.880
My turn!

00:07:11.360 --> 00:07:14.550
When only others have 
monsters on their fields,

00:07:14.550 --> 00:07:18.720
I can Special Summon Constellar 
Siat from my hand.

00:07:21.190 --> 00:07:25.860
Next, I summon Constellar 
Pollux from my hand.

00:07:27.660 --> 00:07:32.970
On the turn that Pollux is summoned, I 
can summon another Constellar monster!

00:07:33.220 --> 00:07:38.100
I summon Constellar Algiedi 
and activate its effect!

00:07:38.770 --> 00:07:42.760
I can Special Summon a Level 4 
Constellar monster from my hand.

00:07:43.040 --> 00:07:46.920
I summon Constellar Kaus!

00:07:48.000 --> 00:07:51.730
You use Xyz, right?

00:07:51.730 --> 00:07:56.020
It irks me that you're using 
it to do horrible things!

00:07:56.820 --> 00:07:59.720
I must defeat you

00:08:00.080 --> 00:08:07.900
to defend Xyz's honor and prove 
that LDS's Xyz is the strongest!

00:08:08.730 --> 00:08:11.170
I activate Kaus's effect!

00:08:12.000 --> 00:08:15.480
Algiedi and Kaus gain one Level.

00:08:17.700 --> 00:08:23.350
I overlay Level 5 Constellar 
Algiedi and Constellar Kaus!

00:08:28.350 --> 00:08:33.060
Light of the stars, shake 
the earth and descend!

00:08:33.280 --> 00:08:34.530
Xyz Summon!

00:08:35.020 --> 00:08:38.100
Rank 5 Constellar Pleiades!

00:08:40.500 --> 00:08:45.170
Then I activate the spell card 
Constellar Twinkle from my hand!

00:08:45.860 --> 00:08:48.800
Constellar Pollux gains two Levels!

00:08:49.110 --> 00:08:51.810
Constellar Siat's effect activates!

00:08:52.080 --> 00:08:55.110
It becomes the same Level as Pollux.

00:08:56.360 --> 00:09:00.520
I overlay Level 6 Pollux and Siat!

00:09:01.480 --> 00:09:04.320
The dazzling light rains down!

00:09:04.320 --> 00:09:05.870
Xyz Summon!

00:09:05.870 --> 00:09:11.580
Appear, Rank 6 Constellar Ptolemy M7!

00:09:12.930 --> 00:09:15.320
He Xyz Summoned consecutively!

00:09:15.320 --> 00:09:16.500
Not bad, Hokuto.

00:09:17.240 --> 00:09:19.440
It's too early to be impressed.

00:09:19.440 --> 00:09:21.710
I activate Constellar Pleiades's effect!

00:09:22.120 --> 00:09:27.360
By using one Overlay Unit, one Vanishing 
Lanius returns to your hand!

00:09:28.280 --> 00:09:30.720
Then I activate Ptolemy's effect!

00:09:31.160 --> 00:09:37.160
By using one Overlay Unit, another 
Vanishing Lanius returns to your hand!

00:09:37.380 --> 00:09:39.380
I end my turn.

00:09:39.380 --> 00:09:41.460
I'm counting on you, Yaiba.

00:09:41.460 --> 00:09:43.730
All right!  Leave it to me!

00:09:49.420 --> 00:09:51.460
You don't want to hurt me?

00:09:51.460 --> 00:09:55.410
How can you say that to 
me while you hurt others?

00:09:57.820 --> 00:10:01.450
You're fine if Masumi gets hurt?

00:10:03.680 --> 00:10:05.560
Who are you?

00:10:05.560 --> 00:10:06.820
Who are you two?

00:10:09.890 --> 00:10:11.200
Here I go!

00:10:11.200 --> 00:10:14.960
I summon XX-Saber Boggart 
Knight from my hand!

00:10:19.020 --> 00:10:21.370
When this monster is summoned,

00:10:21.370 --> 00:10:26.380
I can Special Summon one Level 
4-or-below X-Saber from my hand.

00:10:26.380 --> 00:10:31.540
I summon Level 1 Tuner 
Monster X-Saber Palomuro!

00:10:33.810 --> 00:10:36.750
Since there are two X-Sabers on the field,

00:10:37.040 --> 00:10:40.390
I can Special Summon XX-Saber Faultroll!

00:10:42.440 --> 00:10:47.460
You saw LDS's Xyz, so I'll 
let you see LDS's Synchro!

00:10:47.680 --> 00:10:52.100
Level 1 Palomuro tunes 
Level 4 Boggart Knight!

00:10:54.600 --> 00:10:56.670
Synchro Summon!

00:10:57.020 --> 00:11:00.970
Appear, Level 5 X-Saber Wayne!

00:11:02.610 --> 00:11:04.940
This is only the beginning.

00:11:04.940 --> 00:11:06.310
When it's summoned,

00:11:06.310 --> 00:11:10.250
I can Special Summon a Level 4-or-below 
Warrior-Type monster from my hand.

00:11:11.020 --> 00:11:16.100
I summon the Level 3 Tuner 
Monster XX-Saber Fulhelmknight!

00:11:18.080 --> 00:11:20.790
I activate Faultroll's effect!

00:11:21.020 --> 00:11:24.400
I return X-Saber Palomuro from the graveyard.

00:11:25.820 --> 00:11:27.770
Now for the main event!

00:11:28.270 --> 00:11:32.560
Level 3 Fulhelmknight 
tunes Level 6 Faultroll!

00:11:32.880 --> 00:11:37.440
The silver armor shines!  Crush 
the hopes of the opposition!

00:11:37.580 --> 00:11:38.940
Synchro Summon!

00:11:39.910 --> 00:11:44.620
Come out, Level 9 XX-Saber Gottoms!

00:11:46.790 --> 00:11:48.250
And another!

00:11:48.640 --> 00:11:53.520
Level 1 Palomuro tunes Level 5 X-Saber Wayne!

00:11:53.860 --> 00:11:57.820
Waving your red cape, strike your 
enemy with your swinging sword!

00:11:58.330 --> 00:11:59.730
Synchro Summon!

00:12:01.080 --> 00:12:05.600
Come out, Level 6 XX-Saber Hyunlei!

00:12:10.220 --> 00:12:12.540
Hyunlei's effect activates!

00:12:12.800 --> 00:12:16.520
I can destroy up to three spell 
and trap cards on the field.

00:12:18.720 --> 00:12:23.960
I also use one of Pleiades's Overlay 
Units to activate its effect!

00:12:24.280 --> 00:12:27.600
I return the final Vanishing 
Lanius to your hand.

00:12:28.220 --> 00:12:29.180
Incredible!

00:12:29.180 --> 00:12:31.150
Now he has nothing on his field!

00:12:31.150 --> 00:12:33.870
I'm only getting started.

00:12:34.000 --> 00:12:37.100
I'll use a forbidden technique on you!

00:12:37.330 --> 00:12:41.190
I activate the spell card 
Gottoms' Second Call!

00:12:41.560 --> 00:12:44.010
I Special Summon XX-Saber Faultroll

00:12:44.010 --> 00:12:48.180
and X-Saber Wayne from the 
graveyard with 0 attack points!

00:12:48.500 --> 00:12:53.320
Thanks to Faultroll's effect, I Special 
Summon Fulhelmknight from the graveyard!

00:12:56.310 --> 00:12:58.900
Gottoms's effect activates!

00:12:58.900 --> 00:13:04.120
For every X-Saber that I tribute, 
you discard one card from your hand!

00:13:04.120 --> 00:13:11.620
I tribute Fulhelmknight, Faultroll and 
Wayne to make you discard your entire hand!

00:13:17.840 --> 00:13:20.780
How's that!  You also lost your entire hand!

00:13:21.140 --> 00:13:22.380
Well done.

00:13:22.380 --> 00:13:25.100
It seems they weren't all talk.

00:13:25.860 --> 00:13:28.250
Answer me!  Who are you?

00:13:28.480 --> 00:13:30.000
What's your goal?

00:13:31.920 --> 00:13:37.460
Our enemy took our dear friend, 
so we are trying to rescue her.

00:13:39.540 --> 00:13:41.380
They took your friend?

00:13:42.350 --> 00:13:44.070
You mean Ruri?

00:13:47.010 --> 00:13:50.810
Maybe we're stronger than LDS's Top Team.

00:13:50.810 --> 00:13:52.120
Maybe.

00:13:52.120 --> 00:13:56.750
If they lost to him, that 
means we're the aces.

00:13:57.000 --> 00:13:59.480
Then let's end this quickly.

00:13:59.480 --> 00:14:01.540
I end my turn!

00:14:01.540 --> 00:14:02.450
Masumi!

00:14:02.660 --> 00:14:04.640
You handle the finish!

00:14:04.750 --> 00:14:07.640
Thank you, Yaiba and Hokuto!

00:14:08.440 --> 00:14:10.830
We can draw starting this turn.

00:14:10.880 --> 00:14:12.530
My turn!

00:14:13.460 --> 00:14:17.440
I activate the spell card Gem-Knight Fusion!

00:14:17.880 --> 00:14:21.960
I fuse Gem-Knight Lapis on my field 
with Gem-Knight Lazuli in my hand!

00:14:22.360 --> 00:14:27.330
The blue stone with the secret 
power, become the light and appear!

00:14:27.650 --> 00:14:29.130
Fusion Summon!

00:14:29.600 --> 00:14:33.460
Level 5 Gem-Knight Lady Lapis Lazuli!

00:14:36.140 --> 00:14:39.020
When he saw me, he called me Ruri.

00:14:39.260 --> 00:14:40.160
Ruri?

00:14:40.860 --> 00:14:42.190
Why are you here, Ruri?

00:14:42.720 --> 00:14:45.420
Your friend who was taken - was it Ruri?

00:14:45.560 --> 00:14:47.700
Do I look like her?

00:14:49.760 --> 00:14:51.520
I first thought the same thing.

00:14:51.880 --> 00:14:53.410
Why is Ruri here?

00:14:54.800 --> 00:14:56.600
But you're not Ruri.

00:14:57.080 --> 00:14:59.760
Ruri wouldn't try to learn 
the enemy's summoning method!

00:15:00.080 --> 00:15:00.880
Enemy?

00:15:01.850 --> 00:15:04.820
Gem-Knight Lazuli's effect activates!

00:15:05.040 --> 00:15:07.240
When this card is sent to the graveyard,

00:15:07.240 --> 00:15:10.890
I can return one Normal Monster 
in my graveyard to my hand.

00:15:11.160 --> 00:15:14.630
I return Gem-Knight Lapis to my hand.

00:15:14.800 --> 00:15:18.100
I activate Gem-Knight Fusion's 
effect from the graveyard!

00:15:18.460 --> 00:15:23.180
By banishing one Gem-Knight in my graveyard, 
I can return this card to my hand!

00:15:23.360 --> 00:15:26.110
I banish Gem-Knight Lazuli from my graveyard!

00:15:27.040 --> 00:15:28.780
Here I go again!

00:15:28.920 --> 00:15:31.120
I activate Gem-Knight Fusion!

00:15:31.540 --> 00:15:37.080
I fuse Gem-Knight Alexandrite, Gem-Knight 
Emerald and Gem-Knight Lapis in my hand!

00:15:37.360 --> 00:15:40.000
The magical stone that's both day and night!

00:15:40.000 --> 00:15:42.300
The glimmering green that brings luck!

00:15:42.540 --> 00:15:46.330
Become one with the mysterious 
blue stone and create a new light!

00:15:46.580 --> 00:15:48.290
Fusion Summon!

00:15:48.290 --> 00:15:51.940
Appear, the supreme brilliance 
that illuminates everything!

00:15:51.940 --> 00:15:55.740
Level 9 Gem-Knight Master Diamond!

00:15:56.100 --> 00:15:59.070
Masumi's ace monster has arrived!

00:15:59.360 --> 00:16:02.470
This is LDS's Fusion Summon!

00:16:03.140 --> 00:16:05.440
Fusion Summon is the enemy?

00:16:05.900 --> 00:16:11.180
I'm learning Fusion Summon because I want 
to protect my school and my friends!

00:16:12.440 --> 00:16:14.790
Gem-Knight Master Diamond gains attack points

00:16:14.790 --> 00:16:19.800
equal to the number of Gem monsters in 
the graveyard multiplied by 100 points.

00:16:20.000 --> 00:16:22.760
There are currently three Gem-Knight 
monsters in the graveyard.

00:16:22.960 --> 00:16:25.380
Therefore, it gains 300 attack points!

00:16:26.680 --> 00:16:29.060
Lapis Lazuli's effect activates!

00:16:29.060 --> 00:16:34.280
Once per turn, I can send another Lapis 
Lazuli in my Extra Deck to the graveyard.

00:16:34.770 --> 00:16:39.690
You take damage equal to the 
number of monsters on the field

00:16:39.690 --> 00:16:42.890
summoned from the Extra 
Deck times 100 points...

00:16:42.890 --> 00:16:44.800
...plus half of Lapis Lazuli's attack points.

00:16:44.800 --> 00:16:46.800
There are six monsters on the field!

00:16:46.800 --> 00:16:49.760
Lapis Lazuli has 2400 attack points!

00:16:49.920 --> 00:16:55.120
You take 600 plus 1200 for 
1800 points of damage!

00:16:58.450 --> 00:16:59.850
Now finish him!

00:16:59.850 --> 00:17:01.600
Do it, Masumi!

00:17:02.080 --> 00:17:05.170
Gem-Knight Master Diamond's effect activates!

00:17:05.400 --> 00:17:10.480
It banishes a Level 7-or-below Gem-Knight 
monster from the graveyard to gain its effect!

00:17:10.480 --> 00:17:12.440
I banish Lapis Lazuli.

00:17:12.840 --> 00:17:17.150
Master Diamond activates its effect 
that it gained from Lapis Lazuli!

00:17:17.150 --> 00:17:21.140
I send my third Lapis Lazuli in 
my Extra Deck to the graveyard.

00:17:21.140 --> 00:17:26.840
Six monsters times 100 plus 1650 for 
half of Master Diamond's attack points.

00:17:26.840 --> 00:17:29.080
That's 2250 points of damage!

00:17:29.360 --> 00:17:30.600
That did it!

00:17:30.600 --> 00:17:31.330
We win!

00:17:33.420 --> 00:17:37.300
I activate the trap card Raidraptor 
- Readiness from my graveyard!

00:17:37.680 --> 00:17:43.280
By banishing this card, I can lower my 
life points to 10 to negate effect damage!

00:17:45.160 --> 00:17:47.620
Damn!  He stopped it!

00:17:47.620 --> 00:17:50.080
But he only has 10 life points.

00:17:50.080 --> 00:17:51.750
If Masumi attacks...

00:17:52.080 --> 00:17:56.460
Due to Readiness's effect, battle 
damage is also negated this turn.

00:17:57.280 --> 00:17:59.430
That means even if she attacks...

00:18:00.300 --> 00:18:02.900
I end my turn.

00:18:03.600 --> 00:18:08.870
Like I thought, I didn't sense iron will 
or steel determination in your dueling.

00:18:08.870 --> 00:18:10.120
What?

00:18:10.120 --> 00:18:13.340
You talk big for someone 
on the verge of defeat.

00:18:13.340 --> 00:18:18.810
Yes.  We're on the verge of defeat, 
facing certain destruction.

00:18:19.160 --> 00:18:20.600
“We?”

00:18:20.600 --> 00:18:22.410
What is he talking about?

00:18:22.410 --> 00:18:25.580
But we always stand back up!

00:18:25.580 --> 00:18:29.260
In the end, we overwhelm 
and annihilate the enemy!

00:18:29.260 --> 00:18:31.090
My turn!

00:18:34.680 --> 00:18:38.280
I activate the spell card Dimension Xyz!

00:18:38.600 --> 00:18:40.220
When I have 1000 or fewer life points

00:18:40.220 --> 00:18:44.590
and three copies of the same card 
on the field, hand or graveyard,

00:18:44.590 --> 00:18:46.970
I can use them to Xyz Summon.

00:18:46.970 --> 00:18:50.480
I overlay three Vanishing 
Lanius in my graveyard!

00:18:52.960 --> 00:18:57.880
Hidden falcon, raise your 
sharpened claws from adversity

00:18:57.880 --> 00:19:00.350
and show your wings of rebellion!

00:19:00.350 --> 00:19:02.250
Xyz Summon!

00:19:02.440 --> 00:19:08.800
Appear, Rank 4 Raidraptor - Rise Falcon!

00:19:11.840 --> 00:19:13.770
100 attack points?

00:19:14.000 --> 00:19:19.970
This monster can attack each of your 
Special Summoned monsters once.

00:19:20.360 --> 00:19:22.140
Annihilation?  Whatever!

00:19:22.140 --> 00:19:26.040
It doesn't have enough 
attack points to defeat us!

00:19:26.260 --> 00:19:28.380
I activate Rise Falcon's effect!

00:19:28.940 --> 00:19:31.470
By using one Overlay Unit,

00:19:31.470 --> 00:19:38.760
it gains the attack points of all Special 
Summoned monsters on your fields.

00:19:44.720 --> 00:19:48.320
16400?

00:19:48.320 --> 00:19:49.450
No way!

00:19:49.450 --> 00:19:50.770
Is this for real?

00:19:53.740 --> 00:19:55.070
Let's battle!

00:19:55.070 --> 00:19:57.400
Raidraptor - Rise Falcon!

00:19:57.680 --> 00:19:59.950
Slice all your enemies!

00:20:00.200 --> 00:20:02.680
Brave Claw Revolution!

00:20:20.960 --> 00:20:25.100
We're battling to protect 
Ruri and our friends.

00:20:25.640 --> 00:20:30.780
We want to end this battle and create 
a world where no one gets hurt.

00:20:31.710 --> 00:20:34.700
I don't want to get you 
involved in this battle.

00:20:34.980 --> 00:20:38.420
But if there comes a time where 
you can't avoid battling,

00:20:39.250 --> 00:20:43.390
I want you to survive, even if that 
means having to use Fusion Summon!

00:20:45.640 --> 00:20:51.480
Wanting to change and become stronger 
for your friends isn't wrong.

00:20:53.480 --> 00:20:58.560
With that card, you're 
working hard to change.

00:20:59.560 --> 00:21:06.150
I'll keep fighting to save Ruri, 
our friends and our future.

00:21:07.060 --> 00:21:09.600
You are very similar to Ruri.

00:21:11.620 --> 00:21:12.520
Wait!

00:21:12.760 --> 00:21:13.740
Tell me!

00:21:13.740 --> 00:21:15.040
Who's Ruri?

00:21:16.520 --> 00:21:20.830
Ruri is my friend Syun's younger sister.

00:21:20.830 --> 00:21:23.300
And you?  What's your name?

00:21:23.720 --> 00:21:26.000
My name is Ute.

00:21:26.160 --> 00:21:27.400
Ute...

00:21:34.920 --> 00:21:36.120
Ute...

00:21:48.840 --> 00:21:50.800
You finally showed up.

00:21:50.800 --> 00:21:53.460
I'm done facing weaklings!

00:21:53.740 --> 00:21:55.740
Bring your boss!

00:21:55.740 --> 00:21:57.660
I'm here.

00:22:13.460 --> 00:22:18.940
Catch the dream dancing in my heart
Release my falling tears

00:22:19.160 --> 00:22:28.420
I'll step out on to my first field
To meet my miracle  Fabulous One Step

00:22:35.310 --> 00:22:40.430
I realized that strength can't be given

00:22:40.690 --> 00:22:45.670
It's something I have to grab myself

00:22:45.960 --> 00:22:51.110
In that case, I have to keep moving
I can't stay still

00:22:51.360 --> 00:22:56.370
Even if walls and headwinds block my way

00:22:56.570 --> 00:23:01.970
I'll draw my trump card called 
"courage" to take a step forward

00:23:01.970 --> 00:23:06.390
I believe in my story of victory

00:23:06.680 --> 00:23:12.360
Everyone during battle is My Way
Duelists are being tested

00:23:12.360 --> 00:23:17.770
When times are tough, that's when you 
Smile, Jump, Fight & Step Up!

00:23:17.770 --> 00:23:23.100
Your smile is your Energy
Kick away your feelings of running away

00:23:23.100 --> 00:23:32.410
Jump into the new field
Shiny One Step that leads to the future

00:23:33.440 --> 00:23:40.660
One step... Just one step is fine
That's your Big Chance!!

00:23:45.720 --> 00:23:49.640
Yuya, we both need one more win

00:23:49.640 --> 00:23:54.280
to achieve a 60% win rate and enter 
the Junior Youth Championship!

00:23:54.280 --> 00:23:58.000
Duel me with the entry to the 
championship on the line!

00:23:58.000 --> 00:24:03.160
What?  I have to defeat Gongenzaka 
to enter the championship?

00:24:03.160 --> 00:24:07.630
Without this stipulation, I can't 
have a serious match with you!

00:24:07.630 --> 00:24:12.240
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V:
Immovable Determination!!  Noboru Gongenzaka

00:24:12.240 --> 00:24:14.400
The fun is only getting started!
